# Force LF line endings for all text files on every platform.
# Without this, Windows git with core.autocrlf=true checks files out as CRLF,
# which makes biome (and rustfmt-style tools) fail locally while CI on Linux
# passes against LF-on-disk content.
#
# Git auto-detects binary files (PNG, WebP, ICO, ...) from content, so no
# explicit binary list is needed.
* text=auto eol=lf
